      "title": "Impression Isla Mujeres joins Hyatt's Unbound Collection",
      "summary": "Hyatt announced on November 2, 2026 that Impression Isla Mujeres has joined The Unbound Collection by Hyatt. The property is a 123-suite, adults-only, all-inclusive resort at the southern tip of Isla Mujeres. The affiliation places the resort within Hyatt's curated collection of luxury hotels.",
      "verification": "officially_confirmed",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z",
      "effectiveAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "publisher": "Hyatt",
          "url": "https://newsroom.hyatt.com/2026-november-2-impressionislamujeres-theunboundcollectionbyhyatt",
          "sourceType": "official",
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-11-03T15:01:52.148Z"
        }
      ],
      "terms": null,
      "expiresAt": null,
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-11-03T15:03:40.733Z",
      "changedAt": "2026-11-03T15:03:40.733Z",
      "sourceRunId": "c8880f67-6735-48dd-a8cb-11eaf7c13aa0",
      "changeType": "new",
      "active": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Hyatt said Impression Isla Mujeres is now part of The Unbound Collection by Hyatt, a group the company describes as a curated set of luxury hotels. The resort sits on the southern tip of Isla Mujeres and operates as an adults-only, all-inclusive property with 123 suites.",
        "The announcement covers the brand affiliation only; no rates, opening timeline, or booking conditions were included in the published statement."
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        "Adults-only, all-inclusive resort with 123 suites",
        "Located at the southern tip of Isla Mujeres",
        "Now part of The Unbound Collection by Hyatt"
      ],
      "takeaway": "Travelers planning an Isla Mujeres stay can look for the resort under Hyatt's Unbound Collection branding when comparing options; confirm rates and inclusions directly before booking."
